<a href="#S1.p2.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ pQuant: Towards Effective Low-Bit Language Models via Decoupled Linear Quantization-Aware Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>.
